# Architecture

## Request Flow

```
Route
→ Controller
→ Service
→ Repository
→ Database
```

## Layer Responsibilities

- Routes define API endpoints and apply middleware.
- Controllers are responsible only for handling requests and responses.
- Services contain business logic and manage transactions.
- Repositories are responsible only for data access using Prisma.
- Controllers must not access Prisma directly.
